LAMMPS (29 Oct 2020)
# 2-bead CG-DNA simulation at T = 300 K and 100 mM salt

###### VARIABLES #######
variable    T equal 307
variable    damp equal 1000
variable    seedV equal 4928421
variable    seedT equal 3278431
variable    dt equal 10.0
variable    thermointrv equal 100000
variable    dumpintrv equal 100000
variable    runtime equal 10000000

###### BOX ############
units       real
dimension   3
boundary    p p p
atom_style  full
read_data   in.data
